            {
              "id": "CVE-2025-61726",
              "name": "LanguageSpecificPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "golang: net/url: Memory exhaustion in query parameter parsing in net/url"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "The net/url package does not set a limit on the number of query parameters in a query. While the maximum size of query parameters in URLs is generally limited by the maximum request header size, the net/http.Request.ParseForm method can parse large URL-encoded forms. Parsing a large form containing many unique query parameters can cause excessive memory consumption."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "error"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2025-61726",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2025-61726\nSeverity: HIGH\nPackage: stdlib\nFixed Version: 1.24.12, 1.25.6\nLink: [CVE-2025-61726](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2025-61726)\nThe net/url package does not set a limit on the number of query parameters in a query. While the maximum size of query parameters in URLs is generally limited by the maximum request header size, the net/http.Request.ParseForm method can parse large URL-encoded forms. Parsing a large form containing many unique query parameters can cause excessive memory consumption.",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2025-61726**\n| Severity | Package | Fixed Version | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|HIGH|stdlib|1.24.12, 1.25.6|[CVE-2025-61726](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2025-61726)|\n\nThe net/url package does not set a limit on the number of query parameters in a query. While the maximum size of query parameters in URLs is generally limited by the maximum request header size, the net/http.Request.ParseForm method can parse large URL-encoded forms. Parsing a large form containing many unique query parameters can cause excessive memory consumption."
              },
              "properties": {
                "precision": "very-high",
                "security-severity": "8.0",
                "tags": [
